        "directionRule": "从反对者指向被反对的命题或关系节点。",
        "expressionTemplate": "A(x, y)",
        "participantRule": "二元有序；典型为命题对命题，允许 A(po,S(pi,pj))。反对须真实表达否定，转折词本身不足以成立。",
        "diagramRule": "使用空心圆关系节点和有向边；攻击支持关系时箭头指向该支持关系节点。"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "relationDefinition",
      "value": {
        "id": "4536bccd-4ddb-49fb-a070-44c65e20530e",
        "guideVersionId": "a9055ff9-34b0-4083-9db7-91f82dbe5fc4",
        "code": "J",
        "name": "组合关系",
        "directed": false,
        "minParticipants": 2,
        "maxParticipants": null,
        "sortOrder": 3,
        "createdAt": "2026-10-10T08:00:00Z",
        "createdById": "bca3772c-2ec2-4001-9521-9f825c33a3f2",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T08:00:00Z",
        "updatedById": "bca3772c-2ec2-4001-9521-9f825c33a3f2",
        "recordVersion": 1,
        "definition": "多个成员缺一不可地合取，作为共同理由。",
        "directionRule": "无方向；成员按展示序号从小到大排列。",
        "expressionTemplate": "J(x1, x2, ..., xn)",
        "participantRule": "至少两个命题或已成立的关系整体；每个成员均不能单独承担共同支持。区别于多个独立 S。",
        "diagramRule": "带“+”圆节点连接各成员，连线无箭头；嵌套按指南从内到外构造。"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "relationDefinition",
      "value": {
        "id": "e073dcc0-d315-4cfd-8bb1-3b5aeb9ac919",
        "guideVersionId": "a9055ff9-34b0-4083-9db7-91f82dbe5fc4",
        "code": "M",
        "name": "匹配关系",
        "directed": true,
        "minParticipants": 2,
        "maxParticipants": 2,
        "sortOrder": 4,
        "createdAt": "2026-10-10T08:00:00Z",
        "createdById": "bca3772c-2ec2-4001-9521-9f825c33a3f2",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T08:00:00Z",
        "updatedById": "bca3772c-2ec2-4001-9521-9f825c33a3f2",
        "recordVersion": 1,
        "definition": "个别判断与一般判断之间的对应，是组合的一种特殊形态。",
        "directionRule": "从个别判断或其组合指向一般判断。",
        "expressionTemplate": "M(individual, general)",
        "participantRule": "二元有序；左侧可为个别命题或 J(多个个别判断)，右侧为一般判断；必要时整体嵌入 S 或 J。",
        "diagramRule": "带“+”圆节点的有向结构，箭头指向被匹配的一般判断；M(J(...),...) 按指南特例图示。"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "relationDefinition",
